		{"id":"auditlib","type":"text","text":"### Audit = a shared Java LIBRARY, not a service\nEvery service writes its audit rows into **its own database, in the temple's own schema** — next to the data they describe. No extra database per temple · no service writes into another's data · invisible across temples by construction.","x":800,"y":-250,"width":1250,"height":100,"color":"6"},
